e a swing at me.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000209","line":209,"sourceId":"0042:000209","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「順序良く教えていかないと駄目なんだって」","english":"“You've got to teach her these things in order.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000211","line":211,"sourceId":"0042:000211","speakerJa":"章二","speakerEn":"Shouji","japanese":"「……あの歳なら、\n　普通は処女捨てにかからないか？」","english":"“...At her age, isn't a girl usually trying to lose her virginity?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000212","line":212,"sourceId":"0042:000212","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「冗談じゃないぞ！」","english":"“Don't be ridiculous!”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000214","line":214,"sourceId":"0042:000214","speakerJa":"章二","speakerEn":"Shouji","japanese":"「……過保護」","english":"“...Overprotective.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000215","line":215,"sourceId":"0042:000215","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「む。個性を尊重しているのだよ」","english":"“Hmph. I'm respecting her individuality.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000216","line":216,"sourceId":"0042:000216","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「あずさにはまだ早い」","english":"“Azusa isn't ready yet.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000218","line":218,"sourceId":"0042:000218","speakerJa":"章二","speakerEn":"Shouji","japanese":"「……２７歳くらいになってまだ心の準備ができて\n　ないなんてことになってからじゃ遅いんだぞ？」","english":"“...If she turns twenty-seven and still says she isn't ready, it'll be too late, you know?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000219","line":219,"sourceId":"0042:000219","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「……やめてくれ……想像できない……」","english":"“...Stop. I can't even imagine that...”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000221","line":221,"sourceId":"0042:000221","speakerJa":"章二","speakerEn":"Shouji","japanese":"「まあいいけどな」","english":"“Whatever. Fine.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000223","line":223,"sourceId":"0042:000223","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　煙草に火をつける。\n　男だけの時にしか吸わない。","english":"He lit a cigarette. He smoked only when no women were around.","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000224","line":224,"sourceId":"0042:000224","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「……地球の平和守れってさ」","english":"“...She told you to protect world peace.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000226","line":226,"sourceId":"0042:000226","speakerJa":"章二","speakerEn":"Shouji","japanese":"「ナリは小さいが、スケールはでかいぜ」","english":"“Tiny girl. Big ideas.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000227","line":227,"sourceId":"0042:000227","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「あれフォローすんの誰？」","english":"“And who gets to go smooth things over with her?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000229","line":229,"sourceId":"0042:000229","speakerJa":"章二","speakerEn":"Shouji","japanese":"「おまえ」","english":"“You.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000230","line":230,"sourceId":"0042:000230","speakerJa":"忍","speakerEn":"Shinobu","japanese":"「……なんかいうことは？」","english":"“...Got anything to say?”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000232","line":232,"sourceId":"0042:000232","speakerJa":"章二","speakerEn":"Shouji","japanese":"「…………すまなんだ」","english":"“............My apologies.”","hyperlinks":[],"japaneseHyperlinks":[]},{"ref":"saihate:hyperlinks:0042:000233","line":233,"sourceId":"0042:000233","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"　頭を下げた。","english":"He bowed his head.","hyperl